# Image builds run `docker build -f deploy/docker/Dockerfile.jvm*` with THIS
# directory (kotlin/) as the context and `COPY . .` in the build stage, so the
# Gradle caches and module build outputs below were being tarred to the daemon
# on every image build, and a root-owned .gradle (created once by a
# containerized test run) broke context transfer outright. Excluding them
# makes both impossible. (Dockerfile.msrouter builds from the msrouter
# checkout, a different context: this file never applies to it.)
.gradle
.kotlin
**/build
**/.gradle
**/node_modules
